In a short snippet review, a mentor reviews the following lines. Try to predict the result of running this code:
const obj = { a: 1300, b: 2 };
let keys = '';
for (const p in obj) { keys += p; }
console.log(keys.length);
From this trace, what length is logged?

In a short snippet review, a mentor executes this module. A pull request contains the following change:
console.log('start');
